<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  PLAYER `like`, the frozen 3.6.6 control. A thumbs-up, not the heart the app drew
  before this.

    `Controls > like`             48.5 x 54.33, r9999
    `like > Container`            24.5 x 23.33 at (12, 12) - HUG, so this is ink
    `Container > Icon`            24.5 x 23.33, one SOLID fill, no strokes

  Two things the source settles and this reproduces exactly: the glyph is
  **filled**, not outlined, and its ink is 24.5 x 23.33 sitting 12 from the top of
  its slot rather than centred in it.

  What the source does not settle is the outline itself: the canonical exporter
  records a vector's box, position and fills but never its geometry, so no path
  for this icon exists in the repository. This one is a reconstruction of a
  thumbs-up laid into the frozen box - the silhouette is conventional and the box
  is exact. `tools/figma-export/nav-icons` already exports real geometry via
  `exportAsync(SVG)`; running it over the PLAYER icon nodes would replace this
  path with the literal one. See docs/PLAYER-3.6.6.md.

  Untinted: `player_like` normally - the frozen glyph colour, #3F4A3C light and
  #F5F7FA dark - and `primary` when the track is in the collection, applied from
  the fragment.
-->
<vector xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    android:width="@dimen/player_action_icon_width"
    android:height="@dimen/player_action_icon_height"
    android:viewportWidth="24.5"
    android:viewportHeight="23.33">

    <!-- the cuff -->
    <path
        android:fillColor="#FFFFFF"
        android:pathData="M0,9.33 L4.45,9.33 L4.45,23.33 L0,23.33 Z" />

    <!-- the hand, thumb up -->
    <path
        android:fillColor="#FFFFFF"
        android:pathData="M24.5,10.5 C24.5,9.22 23.28,8.17 22.27,8.17 L15.25,8.17 L16.3,2.83 L16.34,2.46 C16.34,1.98 16.15,1.54 15.85,1.22 L14.67,0 L7.34,7.69 C6.93,8.11 6.68,8.69 6.68,9.33 L6.68,21 C6.68,22.28 7.68,23.33 8.91,23.33 L18.93,23.33 C19.85,23.33 20.64,22.74 20.98,21.91 L24.34,13.68 C24.44,13.42 24.5,13.12 24.5,12.83 Z" />
</vector>
